cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SynthOCR or a dataset made with it, please cite it as below."
title: "SynthOCR: OCR training data for Kurdish"
abstract: >-
  SynthOCR renders text images with exact labels for training and testing
  optical character recognition, built for Sorani and Kurmanji Kurdish with
  Arabic and English.
type: software
